  m_text: "Aithor.io AI, akademik ve profesyonel yaz\u0131lar olu\u015Fturmak i\xE7in
    geli\u015Ftirilmi\u015F bir yapay zeka destekli yazma asistan\u0131d\u0131r.
    Kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n metinlerini planlamalar\u0131na, yap\u0131land\u0131rmalar\u0131na
    ve d\xFCzenlemelerine yard\u0131mc\u0131 olurken, ki\u015Fisel yaz\u0131m tarz\u0131n\u0131
    koruma imkan\u0131 sunar. \xD6zellikle \xF6\u011Frenciler, ara\u015Ft\u0131rmac\u0131lar
    ve i\xE7erik yazarlar\u0131 i\xE7in tasarlanm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 125cb55b44b24c4393181402bc6200e6, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 125cb55b44b24c4393181402bc6200e6, type: 2}
