  m_text: "* YouChat: Do\u011Fal dil i\u015Fleme yetenekleriyle donat\u0131lm\u0131\u015F
    bir sohbet botu, kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n sorular\u0131na an\u0131nda ve
    ki\u015Fiselle\u015Ftirilmi\u015F yan\u0131tlar verir.\n\n* YouWrite: Kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n
    yaz\u0131l\u0131 i\xE7erik olu\u015Fturmas\u0131na yard\u0131mc\u0131 olan bir
    yazma asistan\u0131, blog yaz\u0131lar\u0131, e-postalar ve daha fazlas\u0131
    i\xE7in \xF6neriler sunar.\n\n* YouImagine: Kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n metin
    girdilerine dayal\u0131 olarak g\xF6rseller olu\u015Fturmas\u0131na olanak tan\u0131yan
    bir ara\xE7t\u0131r.\n\n* YouCode: Kodlama g\xF6revlerinde yard\u0131mc\u0131
    olan bir ara\xE7, kod \xF6nerileri ve hata ay\u0131klama deste\u011Fi sa\u011Flar.
    \n\n* Gizlilik Odakl\u0131 Arama: Kullan\u0131c\u0131 verilerini koruma ve reklamlar\u0131
    minimize etme amac\u0131yla tasarlanm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r.\n\n* Genel bir yapay
    zekad\u0131r sana cevab\u0131 vermeden \xF6nce b\xFCt\xFCn sitelerde kaynaklara
    bakarak kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r\u0131p sana bilgilendirme yap\u0131yor
    makale \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmalar\u0131 \xF6n plandad\u0131r."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e498d1c8094910479dc3e1b768306a4, type: 2}
