  m_text: "Fiyatland\u0131rma (2025 itibar\u0131yla)\n\n\xDCcretsiz Plan:\nPDF ile
    sohbet, s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 literat\xFCr taramas\u0131 ve temel yaz\u0131m
    ara\xE7lar\u0131na eri\u015Fim sunar. \n\nPremium Plan:\nAyl\u0131k 12 USD (y\u0131ll\u0131k
    \xF6deme ile). Geli\u015Fmi\u015F \xF6zellikler, s\u0131n\u0131rs\u0131z literat\xFCr
    taramas\u0131, AI yaz\u0131m asistan\u0131 ve daha fazlas\u0131n\u0131 i\xE7erir.\n\nLaboratuvar
    ve \xDCniversite Plan\u0131:\nKullan\u0131c\u0131 ba\u015F\u0131na ayl\u0131k
    8 USD. Laboratuvarlar ve \xFCniversiteler i\xE7in \xF6zel fiyatland\u0131rma
    ve ek \xF6zellikler sunar.\n\n"
