  m_text: "STORM, Stanford \xDCniversitesi'nin Open Virtual Assistant Lab (OVAL)
    taraf\u0131ndan geli\u015Ftirilen, a\xE7\u0131k kaynakl\u0131 bir yapay zeka
    ara\u015Ft\u0131rma arac\u0131d\u0131r. Kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n belirledi\u011Fi
    konular hakk\u0131nda, \xE7ok kaynakl\u0131 ve at\u0131f i\xE7eren, Wikipedia
    benzeri uzun makaleler olu\u015Fturmay\u0131 ama\xE7lar. Ara\xE7, b\xFCy\xFCk
    dil modelleri (LLM'ler) ve web tabanl\u0131 bilgi eri\u015Fimi kullanarak yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015F
    i\xE7erikler \xFCretir. STORM, ara\u015Ft\u0131rmac\u0131lar, \xF6\u011Frenciler
    ve i\xE7erik \xFCreticileri i\xE7in bilgi k\xFCrasyonu ve rapor olu\u015Fturma
    s\xFCre\xE7lerini otomatikle\u015Ftirmeyi hedefler. \nAcer Corner\n+5\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 125cb55b44b24c4393181402bc6200e6, type: 2}
